{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "N15n0006_p0053a09"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0243001", "type": "mod", "text": "anuseti, anusayati 隨眠、止住，如是存在之意。取原典三節終 anusavati, anusayati 之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0318001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0318001", "type": "mod", "text": "a-sapati「無伴夫之妻者」，意為夫之唯一之妻。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁對應之註標[01]與章節校注內容不符，故今將此處修訂為[01]註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004001", "type": "orig", "text": "phoṭṭhabba 譯為「所觸者」較正確，但倣舊來之譯例，唯譯為觸。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0021001", "type": "orig", "text": "除此世尊所說之「一切」，而說示其他之「一切」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0024001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0024001", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本應是一〇而誤為一一以下各節即有齟齬。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047001", "type": "orig", "text": "Migajāla 雜阿含經卷十三之六、七經為鹿網。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照漢譯南傳大藏經中部經典一．一一〇頁後三行之五種欲分。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060001", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本是 mañcake samañcopi 暹羅本為 mañcake samatesi 於前之脚註舉 samadhosi, samidhosi 兩語。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0068001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0068001", "type": "orig", "text": "lujjati, to be broken up, to break, to be destroyed 破壞之意，漢譯「雜阿含」於卷九第三經，以此，有「危脆敗壞」之字，普通「世」釋為「流轉」之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069002", "type": "orig", "text": "對諸佛以教示人之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069001", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋於兩處加上「渴愛」之文字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071001", "type": "orig", "text": "paloka = bhijjana, breaking up, breaking in two, dissolution, decay 敗壞，崩壞，崩解，如八二經，參照一一六經一一節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076001", "type": "orig", "text": "為自殺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076002", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本此一句，作尊者闡陀令持來刀刃。舍利弗之語如次「尊者闡陀續存活……」為以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077003", "type": "orig", "text": "an-upavajja-appavattika, appaṭisandhika「又不得有」之意，彼今罹重病，恢復無望故斯言。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078004", "type": "orig", "text": "由渴愛、憍慢、邪見，而依止、依賴之意（註）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078005", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本作 nati（偏向），暹羅本及註釋作 nandi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078006", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本作 agatigati（惡趣處）暹羅本及註釋作 āgatigati（往來），為來和往。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079007", "type": "orig", "text": "一四節，闡陀自言：「此應無再有矣。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079008", "type": "orig", "text": "anupajja 之語以解闡陀「此應無再有矣」之意（一四），世尊：「更不受此身」之意，（闡陀同意）解之（二四），舍利弗之 upavajja「令親往來」（upasaṁkamitabba）之意解之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079009", "type": "orig", "text": "自盡同時入涅槃（samasīsī）之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本（新版）於此之次，富樓那！由此，汝，如是說彼遠離此法、律，「有一比丘白世尊言」云云，由七一經之二節之文脈推之，更從最後三節四節更加上長文。但對此在 PTS 本沒言什麼而推之，可見完全是衍文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0083002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0083002", "type": "orig", "text": "持此之餘，持此生命之餘而求死，「持刀者」謂持刀來殺自己的人。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0083003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0083003", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本我是求其執刀者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0087001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0087001", "type": "orig", "text": "動著是言渴愛。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0087002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0087002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照三〇經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0089001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0089001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本此亦說四種思量。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0090001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0090001", "type": "orig", "text": "於眼之色，於耳之聲等，謂對境隨有二法，不然者謂非境（a-visaya）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093001", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本用 saḷavagga 之語，暹羅本及註，用 chaḷavagga。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094002", "type": "orig", "text": "此譯依 PTS 本 Saddhādutiyā viharantānavassutā 漢譯雜阿含經卷十一第七經之偈中，謂「正信心不二諸漏不漏心」相當此。暹羅註釋本有 Saddhādutlyā viharantenapasutā。「信心為副而專住」之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108001", "type": "orig", "text": "原語 idaṁ 是「此」之意，註釋謂此是虛字，若為「余」即易解。註釋亦如是註之，參照下文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112001", "type": "orig", "text": "「〔由欲、有、見、無明之〕四軛之〔脫離〕為安穩因」（註）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112002", "type": "orig", "text": "「法教者乃法因」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0120001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0120001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本一一一和一一二合為一經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0122001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0122001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本以下獨立一經。若從「侍聞」之經題看，此亦有一理，似是斷絕，唯以下即無任何意義之經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0125001", "type": "orig", "text": "依註之「世間之終」（lokassa anto），謂輪迴世界之終，即言終結輪迴之轉生。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0127002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0127002", "type": "orig", "text": "對 loka-saññī, loka-māni 註有 loko ti sañjānāti c'eva maññati ca，乃「以為世想者，以為世思者」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0130001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0130001", "type": "orig", "text": "為心之防護，應不放逸，應常正念，謂非於過去之已知境（āyatana-vidita）是於未來當知境（āyatana-veditabba）之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0130002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0130002", "type": "orig", "text": "「對色之想」，乃色之概念。對香、味、觸、法亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131003", "type": "orig", "text": "以下本經（一一七）和一一六經之異，唯此「中」之文句而已。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131004", "type": "orig", "text": "於原典：「離欲」換用 nirujjhati「滅」。余倣六節以下之文而用「離欲」暹羅字作 virajjati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0132005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0132005", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一一六經七。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0133006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0133006", "type": "orig", "text": "六處（處於上面譯為境，同一原語）之滅盡謂涅槃。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0136001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0136001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同一一八經，唯五結天子換「諸天主帝釋」而已。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0138001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0138001", "type": "orig", "text": "āvaraṇa = nīvaraṇa，謂指貪欲、瞋恚、惛沈、掉悔，疑等五種。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0138002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0138002", "type": "orig", "text": "夜間之十二小時三分而稱為初分、中分、後分。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0143001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0143001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一〇九經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0144001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0144001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一一〇經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0144002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0144002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下一二二經之三同以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0146001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0146001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一一八經之三。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0151001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0151001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一一八、一一九、一二四～一二六經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0151001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0151001", "type": "mod", "text": "參照一一八、一一九、一二四【南傳】，～一二六經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0152001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0152001", "type": "orig", "text": "眼界異色界異喜處、二因緣生識、三事和合生觸，又喜觸因緣生樂受（雜含卷十七．五）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0154001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0154001", "type": "orig", "text": "「此為如是」，於此謂色之可意。PTS 本及暹羅本「眼識」之次有「當感樂」之語。依註釋所示之意，照另一異本之所示，此語應可省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0155001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同一一八經四～九。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0155001", "type": "mod", "text": "以下同一一八經四【南傳】，～九。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0155002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同一一八經一一～一六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0155002", "type": "mod", "text": "以下同一一八經一一【南傳】，～一六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0156001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0156001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經卷九，於三十一經為「獼猴室」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0156002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0156002", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本為 selissaka 暹羅本為 seleyyaka 在暹羅本的註釋為 selokassaka 互相捕背而跳起，註為彼此於行苦熱的（？tāpana）「遊戲」，如蛙跳。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0156003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0156003", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本雖為 jappāmase 照暹羅本之註解為 jahāmhase，以 jahama, sajjhāmā 之語註之，以採用此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168001", "type": "orig", "text": "此八偈和 Sn. 759-765 幾乎同樣，唯此一句二三言不同，故變成相反之意義，即於此成為 santikena vijānanti mahādhamma-kovidā 於 Sn. 為 santikena vijānanti magādhammass'akovidā 可以取為「不熟」〔如〕獸之徒，不知近涅槃。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同上之三節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168003", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同上之三節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0171001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0171001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一三七經之第九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0171001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0171001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "同一經之第九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0172001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0172001", "type": "orig", "text": "同一經之第九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0173001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0173001", "type": "orig", "text": "見一經之九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0173001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0173001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "見一經之九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0174001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0174001", "type": "orig", "text": "見一經之九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175001", "type": "orig", "text": "見一經之九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0179001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0179001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下參照三二經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0181001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0181001", "type": "orig", "text": "有內住、有師範，於註解，註為有內住之煩惱，有規範行之煩惱。於雜阿含經卷八之四〇、四一兩經，譯為「有近住弟子、有師」，無內住、無師範之意，應隨此而解。意義於六節以下即明白。內住弟子及師範之有無，以通諸惡不善法有無之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0182002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0182002", "type": "orig", "text": "本經三節 vussati 有（修），此二〇節有（稱）vuccati。雖認為那一個都可以，後者較佳，即「此稱為無內住、無師範之梵行」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0184001", "type": "orig", "text": "於此落失眼識一條。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0184001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "pariyaya 一般譯為「方便」，此英譯為 method，余依註釋 kāraṇa 譯為因由。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0193001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0193001", "type": "orig", "text": "於此可譯為應捨汝之欲。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0198001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0198001", "type": "orig", "text": "Peyyāla 依「翻釋名義大集」譯為乃至廣說。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經卷八．三八經：「眼是人大海，彼色為濤波，若能堪色濤波者，得度眼大海竟。」（參照大正藏二．五四c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0210001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0210001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經卷八．三六經：「悉於其中貪樂沈沒，如狗肚藏，如亂草蘊，此世彼世，絞結纏銷亦總如是。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0214001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0214001", "type": "orig", "text": "原語 Khira-rukkha 余直譯之，如護謨樹之一種，以下列舉樹，皆如分泌之護謨樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0214002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0214002", "type": "orig", "text": "此數字似缺正確，以從協會本之原典。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0216001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0216001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經卷九，二六經：「眼繫色耶？色繫色耶？」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0218001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0218001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同一九一經之四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0218002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0218002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同一九一經之五。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同三〇經二節之末文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0222001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0222001", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本作 vanjha（不生產）余採用暹羅本 vajja（過誤之意）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223002", "type": "orig", "text": "同二八經之九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0229001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0229001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文 yoni cassa āraddhā hoti āsavānaṁ khayāya「諸漏滅盡，始為彼之起源。」「原由」云云，是依註釋之 kāraṇañ c'assa paripuṇṇaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0229002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0229002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同一二〇經六節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0229003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0229003", "type": "orig", "text": "調御可能馬之馭者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0230004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0230004", "type": "orig", "text": "同一二〇經之七節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231001", "type": "orig", "text": "於原典示為「龜」以 kumma, kacchapa 二語，於註釋解此為同義語，故單一語譯出。kacchapa 者 kaccha 即從腋，Pa 是飲義。即信為從前肢腋之附著點而飲水。於名義燈，此二語外還有 nakka 一語。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231002", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經卷四三．四經有「龜蟲見來即藏六」之句。言龜為藏六即由此句而云。六是頭尾加四肢。然原典用 soṇḍipañcamāni aṅgāni 之語，「首為第五支分」之意，這想是尾之一除外。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0232003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0232003", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一二〇經之六節，一九八經之九節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0233001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0233001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經卷四三．一一經：「不關洲渚。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0235002", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本二語 ekacco ekacco 重疊，是衍字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0235003", "type": "orig", "text": "原文「著此岸」是衍字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0236004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0236004", "type": "orig", "text": "參照六七經之一七節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0237001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0237001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下同二〇〇經之四～一一節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0237001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0237001", "type": "mod", "text": "以下同二〇〇經之四【南傳】，～一一節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0237002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0237002", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本單有 vuṭṭhāna，依此，以「想不犯而止者，即有脫出之道」義譯之，但暹羅本此加 na，因此意為「不關知若犯罪者，將無脫出之道」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0240001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0240001", "type": "orig", "text": "同一三二經之一〇節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0240002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0240002", "type": "orig", "text": "cakkhuto 於註釋 cakkhubhāvena「依眼」，為「眼」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0241003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0241003", "type": "orig", "text": "同一三二經之一八節下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243001", "type": "orig", "text": "anuseti, anusayati 隨眼、止住，如是存在之意。取原典三節終 anusavati, anusayati 之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一三二經之一〇～一七節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0245002", "type": "mod", "text": "參照一三二經之一〇【南傳】，～一七節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245003", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一三二經之一八～二四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0245003", "type": "mod", "text": "參照一三二經之一八【南傳】，～二四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245004", "type": "orig", "text": "參照九六經之四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0248001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0248001", "type": "orig", "text": "kiṁsuka 甄（堅）叔迦、緊祝迦、緊獸（雜阿含經卷四三之一二經。）「為何」之意，花樹名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0248002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0248002", "type": "orig", "text": "pañhāvyakaraṇa「質問釋答」之意，以應質問之反答。在雜阿含經卷四三之一二經為「記說」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0251001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0251001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經四三卷六經：「眼識色因緣生，若欲若貪，若昵若念，若決定著處，於彼諸心善自防護。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252002", "type": "orig", "text": "kiṭṭha 有稻或稻田之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252003", "type": "orig", "text": "upari ghaṭāya（ṁ）suniggahitaṁ niggaṇheyya 此段之意稍稍不明瞭，照此譯待後日之研究。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252004", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經四三卷六經，過去世時，有王聞未曾有好彈琴聲。琴及琵琶皆相當於 vīṇa。唯依我們之通常觀念，說琴，無寧較接近琵琶 vīṇa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0254001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0254001", "type": "orig", "text": "於英譯，譯為 a swampy jangle（濕地之森）；註釋書，註為 kaṇṭavana（棘之森），此較自然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0254002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0254002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一三二經之一〇～一五經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0254002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0254002", "type": "mod", "text": "參照一三二經之一〇【南傳】，～一五經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255003", "type": "orig", "text": "visaya 目的物，對象體，對境，境界。gocara 有種種之意，於此是置動物餌之處，即餌處，餌之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256004", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一三二之一八～二三節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0256004", "type": "mod", "text": "參照一三二之一八【南傳】，～二三節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0258001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0258001", "type": "orig", "text": "縛兩手兩足，更繁首故，首為第五繩所縛。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0259002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0259002", "type": "orig", "text": "原典 rāga 雖有染欲，雜阿含經四二卷六經有為「病」。註亦有 roga，看 rāga 是 roga 之誤，故譯為病。於漢譯大約為「病、癰刺」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0264001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0264001", "type": "orig", "text": "註為 pātāla「十分足於墮落，言此為無立足處 pātāla」，於大海中常起之渦漩之類，以言為險崖亦說不定。這本來不存在而誤認為存在。雜阿含經一七卷一八經譯為「深險」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0264002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0264002", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經一七卷一八經：「長淪沒溺，無止息處。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268001", "type": "orig", "text": "Kalam āgameti 時來，待時之意，當譯余決心以「渡時」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269002", "type": "orig", "text": "paṭicca prati+i……。由於「甚麼」，以甚麼為基礎之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269003", "type": "orig", "text": "vayānupassin 為以觀消滅。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照七經二部，以下各節參照前經之各節，兩經之不同、於七經之六～八節有樂、苦、非苦非樂之三受，言為緣身。於八經言此等諸受為緣「觸」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一二五～一二九經之四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0274001", "type": "mod", "text": "參照一二五【南傳】，～一二九經之四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0277001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0277001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿舍經一七卷二二經：「又復說諸所有受，悉皆是苦。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0277002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0277002", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經一七卷二二經：「初禪正受時，言語寂滅，第二禪正受時，覺觀寂滅，第三禪正受時，喜心寂滅，第四禪正受時，出入息寂滅云云。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0279001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0279001", "type": "orig", "text": "四、五兩偈參照三經之六節四、五偈。雜阿含一七卷一六經有「正知不傾動」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280001", "type": "orig", "text": "本經及次之標題 santaka 於英譯譯為 Property（所有、所有物），此兩經中沒有一句暗示此意義。及之止息之意兩經有六節，因此余譯為止息，想是由語根 s'an 來的。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下五、六兩節，同一一經五、六兩節、七節稍為不同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0282001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0282001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一五經之四、五、六、七之四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0282001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0282001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "以下三～六之四節同一五經之三～六節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0282001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0282001-1", "type": "mod", "text": "以下三【南傳】，～六之四節同一五經之三～六節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0283002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0283002", "type": "orig", "text": "同一一經之七節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0284001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0284001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下三～八節同一六經之三～八節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0284001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0284001", "type": "mod", "text": "以下三【南傳】，～八節同一六經之三～八節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0285001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0285001", "type": "orig", "text": "中部五九經 Bahu-vedaniya-sutta 同「多受經」。參照漢譯南傳大藏經二第十卷一四九～一五四頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0285001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0285001", "type": "mod", "text": "中部五九經 Bahu-vedaniya-sutta 同「多受經」。參照漢譯南傳大藏經二第十卷一四九【南傳】，～一五四頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0286002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下各種受，於二二經說明。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0290001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0290001", "type": "orig", "text": "此一節同一九經九節之後部。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0290002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0290002", "type": "orig", "text": "此一文於原典被抄入的，和一九同樣，似是為本節之末文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295001", "type": "orig", "text": "三、四兩節同一五經之三、四兩節，但本經之四節有「渴愛達受生起之道」之一句，此在一五經沒有。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一五經之三節，二三經之三節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一五經之四節，二三經之四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0298001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0298001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一五、二三、二四經之三、四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0299001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0299001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下參照相應部因經品一三經沙門婆羅門。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0299001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0299001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "以下參照二六經之三、四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0300001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0300001", "type": "orig", "text": "有食樂（sa-āmisa）無食樂（nirāmisa）之語既出於一四經四節。三節以下之喜是 pīti，樂是 sukha，捨是 upekhā，解脫是 vimokkha。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一九經一一節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301003", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一九經一二、一三節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301004", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一九經一一節，二九經四節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0302005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0302005", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一九經一一節，二九經四、七節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0302006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0302006", "type": "orig", "text": "參照一九經一五節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0318001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0318001", "type": "orig", "text": "a-sapati「無伴夫之妻者」，意為夫之唯一之妻。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0318002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0318002", "type": "orig", "text": "Puttavatī assaṁ「無兒之女人」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0322001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0322001", "type": "orig", "text": "食閻浮果之意，於雜阿含經一八卷一經有「閻浮車」。於註釋，註為長老（可能是舍利弗）之甥 Jambukhādaka 普行沙門，是名闡怒沙門。即舍利弗長老之甥普行沙門嗜好食閻浮果而得是名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0324001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0324001", "type": "orig", "text": "dhammavādin, supatipanna, sugata 說法者，善實行，善到達（善逝）之意，雜阿含經一八卷一經為：「善說法者，世間正向，世間善逝。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0326001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0326001", "type": "orig", "text": "assāsa 是入息之意，看次節之文，在此可取為安息（breathing easily; relief consolation）之意。雜阿含經一八卷一經有「蘇息」以 paramassāsa 為止蘇息。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0327001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0327001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下除「安息」和「最上安息」之不同外，其他皆同第五經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0328001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0328001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下「苦」和「受」之不同外，皆同第四經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0328001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0328001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "以下「諸漏捨棄」和「諸受知悉」之不同外，其他皆同第七經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0329001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0329001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下參照第八經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0329001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0329001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "於雜阿含經有：「欲愛、色愛、無色愛。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0329002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0329002", "type": "orig", "text": "以下參照第八、第九經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0330001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0330001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下參照第八、九、十之三經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0331001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0331001", "type": "orig", "text": "上之三經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0332001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0332001", "type": "orig", "text": "dhamma-vinaya, Doctrine and Discipline 法與律，教法和規律，綜合佛教之教理行規，解為「佛教」之意。即「教」之意義。此一文於雜阿含經一八卷一經為：「賢聖法律中有何難事。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0333002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0333002", "type": "orig", "text": "abhirati 言樂出家生活。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0347001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0347001", "type": "orig", "text": "佛弟子在嚴密之意義：若到了預流，一來不還，阿羅漢道以後，總稱為四雙，此四各有向和果，而稱為四雙八輩。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0352002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0352002", "type": "orig", "text": "於 PTS 本，此數字誤寫為六〇，最後之數字是六三，第十一旃檀天子以下之五經亦皆為六三，正確都應為六二。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0353001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0353001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下有括弧十二～十五之數字是由日譯者之意而記上的，於攝頌有「十一」之語，省略為是，但此等五經同第十帝釋經有舉一～六二節之數字，故第十二以下如視為一經為正確。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0355001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0355001", "type": "orig", "text": "Macchikāsaṇḍa 於雜阿含經二一卷一四經有摩師山 Ambātakavana 同二一卷八經為菴羅林。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0356002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0356002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照相應部（三五）六處相應之一九一經三～五節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0356002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0356002", "type": "mod", "text": "參照相應部（三五）六處相應之一九一經三【南傳】，～五節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0358001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0358001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照相應部〔三五〕六處相應之一二九經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0366001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0366001", "type": "orig", "text": "如唯言食事，而感為熱苦之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0370001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0370001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照中部四四有明小經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0375001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0375001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照〔三六〕受相應一九般奢康伽經之一八節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0378001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0378001", "type": "orig", "text": "此一文於此有「吾等」之語，還是質多居士之言。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0379002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0379002", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含經二一卷一六經：「若無一問一說一記論乃至十問十說十記論，云何能誘於我而來至此菴羅林中欲誘誑我。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0379003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0379003", "type": "orig", "text": "paṭiharati，PTS 辭典譯為 to strike in return。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0380001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0380001", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 辭典譯為「拔髮」，然亦解為以馬尾（之拂塵）拂塵埃之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0381002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0381002", "type": "orig", "text": "原典出於 Kiṁhi no pi siyā bhante「大德！於何無此耶？」之文有一本之脚註作 Gihino pi siyā bhante 故，而如是譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0001a1201", "type": "add", "text": "第一無常品【CB】，［－］【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0104a1401", "type": "add", "text": "昧【CB】，味【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0105a0101", "type": "add", "text": "昧【CB】，味【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0110a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0110a1201", "type": "add", "text": "昧【CB】，味【南傳】"}
